1
00:00:00,922 --> 00:00:04,422
A moment ago, you turned off the TV
in the middle of the Deep Space Nine...

2
00:00:04,593 --> 00:00:08,473
...Star Trek: The Original Series
"Trouble With Tribbles" crossover episode.

3
00:00:11,349 --> 00:00:13,519
(Sheldon:)Would you like some advice?

4
00:00:14,561 --> 00:00:15,641
(Leonard:)Sure, why not?

5
00:00:15,812 --> 00:00:18,272
(Sheldon:)Then this is the perfect time
to launch a blog...

6
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,070
(Sheldon:)...with an interactive comments section.

7
00:00:22,527 --> 00:00:23,657
(Leonard:)Gee, thanks a lot.

8
00:00:24,821 --> 00:00:26,861
(Sheldon:)Would you rather I offer
my personal insight?

9
00:00:27,032 --> 00:00:28,912
No, I don't need any insights.

10
00:00:29,075 --> 00:00:32,415
I just wanna know why Penny's
more interested in Stuart than me.

11
00:00:32,579 --> 00:00:34,369
(Leonard:)We're practically the same guy.

12
00:00:34,539 --> 00:00:36,369
(Sheldon:)Oh, I disagree.

13
00:00:36,541 --> 00:00:39,671
You know, Stuart is taller,
artistic, self-employed...

14
00:00:39,836 --> 00:00:44,716
(Sheldon:)...and, most significantly,
he gets 45 percent off comic books.

15
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:52,053
(Leonard:)You're right. I really should be asking
strangers on the Internet.

16
00:00:53,725 --> 00:00:56,355
(Sheldon:)My original point.

17
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:01,234
(Sheldon:)Chinese food, vintage video games.

